WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.060
SCP-096 Vs SCP-689.

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:08.640
The monster whose face you never want to see
illuminated vs the mass-murdering haunter

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:09.640
of the dark.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:12.840
Who would win, the Shy Guy or this Sinister
Statue?

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:18.040
689 is a small soapstone statue that puts
anyone who sees it in grave danger.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:21.910
Once they first see it, the second they look
away, they’ll be instantly killed, and the

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.480
statue will appear sitting on their corpse.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:29.880
And of course, SCP-096 will mercilessly hunt
down and eviscerate anyone who makes the mistake

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:31.520
of seeing its face.

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:35.350
But despite the danger of both anomalies,
we call this one a draw.

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:36.350
Why?

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:40.210
The statue can’t see, and thus, wouldn’t
activate 096’s rage state.

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:44.890
Also, one of the popular theories about 096
is that it’s actually blind, meaning it

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:47.829
would never see and activate 689 either.

00:00:47.829 --> 00:00:51.269
The two may just awkwardly stand around until
something else happened!

